<p>Infuse your body with untethered aether forces for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns.</p><p>While active, the cooldown for Arcane and Aether spells is divided by 3, your arcane damage and penetration is increased by 25%, your Disruption Shield radius is increased to 10, and your maximum mana is increased by 33%.</p><p>Using non arcane based spells in this state is hard and makes you lose 50 mana each time (up to once per turn).</p><p></p><p>Spells considered arcane for the purpose of not-losing mana are:</p><p></p>